From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:29:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(job-offers): resolve sprint 1 QA defects in publish
 wizard

- D-7, D-8: publish fails fast offline instead of pausing and auto-sending
- D-5, D-6: salary accepts space as range separator and ignores a leading dash
- D-13: show the 500 vacancies limit message when the value is capped
- D-15: browser back returns to the previous wizard step keeping the data
- D-4, D-9, D-10: stepper, card width and actions fit on mobile and tablet
- Add missing accents to wizard labels and placeholders

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0162UBxebTVK1cF9ijNgmYxy
